,"events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/foxp552/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/foxp552/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-12T16:34:09Z","updated_at":"2025-07-12T16:41:42Z","body":"> > gpu = nv GT730\n> \n> This GPU has no Vulkan or real D3D12 support, only projects using Compatibility renderer should work.\n\nwould installing vulkan do any help ? XD","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3065839394/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3065845792","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108550#issuecomment-3065845792","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108550","id":3065845792,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc62vRgg","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-12T16:41:56Z","updated_at":"2025-07-12T16:44:15Z","body":"> from now on ?\n\nIt never did, it's possible 4.4.1 renderer changes cause it to try to fall back to D3D12 first ([there are issues](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98848) with ancient GPUs with incomplete D3D12 support, and it might crash when trying it) and 4.3 was falling back directly to OpenGL. Manually switching projects to the `Compatibility` (or adding `--rendering-driver opengl3` or `--rendering-driver opengl3_angle` to the command line) should work.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3065845792/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":1,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3638419519","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108550#issuecomment-3638419519","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108550","id":3638419519,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Y3eA_","user":{"login":"Rudolph-B","id":52322745,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMzIyNzQ1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52322745?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rudolph-B","html_url":"https://github.com/Rudolph-B","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rudolph-B/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rudolph-B/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rudolph-B/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rudolph-B/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rudolph-B/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rudolph-B/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rudolph-B/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rudolph-B/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rudolph-B/received_events","type"